  assert.equal(ACCOUNT_VERSION, 'acct173');   // PIN MOVED: acct173, LOST-SPOILS (a boss's floor's leftovers to the post from the Lost and Found - /v1/post/lost; acct168 on its branch, renumbered past STAFF-PANEL1, CRAFT-PAYS, PISTOLET, AUDIT COLLECTIONS-II and SEA VENTURES at the merge; no migration); PIN MOVED: acct172, SEA VENTURES (acct168 on its branch, then acct169, renumbered past STAFF-PANEL1, CRAFT-PAYS, PISTOLET and AUDIT COLLECTIONS-II at the merges - the Eltheric Ocean ventures, one release: item law 11 and the nine records of the Eltheric Tidemail; the season boards of the sea, its bounties and the prizes of its wrecks; migrations from 0146); PIN MOVED: acct171, AUDIT COLLECTIONS-II (the glyph and icon doors answer the honours and the titles of a Charter; acct169 on its branch, renumbered past CRAFT-PAYS and PISTOLET at the merge); PIN MOVED: acct170, PISTOLET (the item law moved to 10 - the Dwarven Pistolet known to the judge, the Sunken Sovereign lawful as a gilded Pistolet and as the saber minted before; acct168 on its branch, renumbered past STAFF-PANEL1 and CRAFT-PAYS at the merge); PIN MOVED: acct169, CRAFT-PAYS and CRAFT-WRITS, one release (a Novice brew answers two potions; the crafting writs - craftWrits.js, /v1/writs/craft, migration 0145; acct168 and migration 0144 on its branch, renumbered past STAFF-PANEL1 at the merge); PIN MOVED: acct168, STAFF-PANEL1 (the staff panel sign-in - a password, a key only the Staff Panel extension holds and the role lists; staff keys, invites, sessions and an append-only audit, migration 0144); PIN MOVED: acct167, CAKE-CAP-SAID (a festival find answers the cakes found that day, and capped once they are all found; the account festival answers them too; acct166 on its branch, renumbered past ESSENCE-LOOSE and SOUL-LAW at the merge); PIN MOVED: acct166, ESSENCE-LOOSE (Arcane Essence of a piece made of loose goods is loose, never gold, and the Reforge spends it; migration 0142) and SOUL-LAW (item law 9 - a soul of